    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As each arrowhead pierce the flesh of a Strider, Lena Morwyn ponders...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;What is this place? I bare the scar from one of those creatures and yet I live. Surviving is feasible.&quot;<br><br>SOLO DEVELOPED</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and gather different resources used for crafting and upgrading equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay energised and hydrated throughout the journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight different Striders and harvest their bodies for hide, meat and bones</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use stealth tactics in the environment when Strider engagement is unwanted</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE FROM THE DEVELOPER:<br>This game is still very early in the development process and has a lot more content to come!</p>",
